# Primary intents to serve

**Commercial:** prices · payment plans · inventory types · launch / phase story · comparison vs West Cairo alternatives

**Investor:** ORA Developers Egypt · Naguib Sawiris portfolio context · New Zayed / West Cairo growth thesis · accessibility (airport, arterials)

**Locale:** New Zayed · Sheikh Zayed · West Cairo · Mehwar El Dabaa · Sphinx Airport · Waslet Dahshour

# Keyword themes (use naturally; avoid stuffing)

- **Branded:** Solana West, Solana West New Zayed, ORA Developers Egypt, Naguib Sawiris
- **Transactional:** prices, payment plan, villas, townhouses, apartments, twin houses, new launch, luxury compound
- **Geo:** New Zayed compounds, West Cairo investment, Sheikh Zayed villas (where relevant)

Long-tail examples (rotate; do not repeat verbatim on every page):

- Solana West payment plan, Solana West villas New Zayed, ORA New Zayed project, luxury villas New Zayed Egypt, compounds near Sphinx Airport, installment villas New Zayed

# Page-level SEO requirements

Each indexable URL should intentionally include:

- **One H1** matching primary intent; logical **H2+** outline (see **15** for heading/metadata pairing)
- **Above-the-fold** answer to “what / where / from how much / how to pay / handover” using **canonical facts** from **01**
- **Internal links** to money pages (prices, payment plan, location, project hub, contact) and topical hubs (blog / guides) with **natural anchors**
- **FAQ** where it reduces bounce and matches real objections; **FAQ schema only if visible** (see **08**)
- **CTA** placement per **06**; events per **12**

Avoid: duplicate boilerplate intros, keyword lists disguised as prose, conflicting prices or dates vs **01**.

# Content & depth

Every section should justify its existence: **entity clarity**, **trust**, or **conversion**. Prefer:

- Area + accessibility **facts** (map to **01** proximity claims)
- Product truth (unit mix, finishing, masterplan story)
- Investor framing without **unverified** ROI (see **07**)

Depth checklist (details live in **04-content-depth**): area · developer · product · payment · delivery · lifestyle · audience (GCC / family / international) as relevant.

# Local & competitive context

**Strengthen locale** around New Zayed, West Cairo, Mehwar El Dabaa, airport and main roads.

**Competitive set (positioning, not disparagement):** VYE Sodic, Belle Vie Emaar, Palm Hills, Mountain View, Sodic, Emaar Misr — differentiate on **density, walkability, ORA brand, planning, villa elevation**, with **verifiable** claims only.

# Blog / editorial (optional but scalable)

Pillar angles: prices, payment plans, launches, area growth, investment thesis, ORA / Sawiris context, comparisons, “best compounds” **only** with defensible criteria.

# Technical SEO (site implementation)

Coordinate with **13** (performance, sitemap, robots, Core Web Vitals) and **10** (image delivery): fast LCP, mobile-first, structured internal linking, clean HTML, index hygiene.

# Social discovery (organic, off-site)

On-site SEO mentions of social are **minimal**; **channel playbooks** live in **14-social-media-system**. Keep **one** consistent CTA line to WhatsApp where relevant.

